## Develop

- `llm-rosetta ext check .` validates this folder (manifest, tree, packaging).
- The folder is the package: a build writes `build/` and `*.egg-info` inside it, so build from a clean copy.
- Import only the standard library and `llm_rosetta.contracts`.
